      "title": {
        "en": "Attentive handling and social enrichment"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Dog owners report that their pets are eager to enter the facility and return home well-exercised. Clients note that attendants accommodate individual pet temperaments, including visually impaired dogs. While one owner reported a minor scrape, most observe attentive supervision during group play."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 7,
      "title": {
        "en": "Caring team and familiar attendants"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients appreciate the welcoming reception and attentive floor staff who recognize regular canine visitors by name. Daily updates and feedback at pickup reassure guardians about their pets' wellbeing. Reviewers highlight dedicated handlers who take time to comfort anxious pets during both daycare and boarding stays."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 4,
      "title": {
        "en": "Grooming outcomes and play stamina"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Feedback regarding grooming and boarding outcomes is largely favorable, with owners noting neat styling and thoroughly tired dogs after active play sessions. However, one visitor reported an uneven haircut and a surface scratch on their pet, resulting in mixed overall sentiment regarding service consistency."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Is an assessment required before attending daycare?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, dogs must complete an initial behavioral assessment before joining group daycare, and first-time appointments should be scheduled through the front desk."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "What services does Dogaholics provide?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "The facility offers dog daycare, overnight boarding suites, and pet grooming appointments with package add-ons."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Do attendants send updates during boarding stays?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, pet owners report receiving daily verbal check-ins at pickup as well as optional photo postcard updates during extended boarding stays."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    }
